Rectangle=30 15 37 19 WALL
BoundaryFill=33 17 DIAMOND WALL
FillRect=14 16 20 20 WALL SPACE
FloodFill=16 18 BOULDER SPACE
Raster=22 16 3 3 2 2 BOULDER
